## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the `enc_flag` file using `wget`.
2. See the content using `cat`.
3. Convert the encoded data into normal data by  using `cyberchef(frombase64,rot 13 bruteforce)` by doing base64 twice on `enc_flag data` and  `https://www.dcode.fr/caesar-cipher` by doing shifting 19 characters forward.
4. Another method is using `echo` command with `tr 'a-z' 't-za-s'` after finding the base64 deocding twice or use separate one `step 2 on code /terminal snippet ones.`.
5. The flag will be displayed.

